{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13215030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13215030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1321503001:1":{"text":"好久不见！梅丽莎，伽利！","source_cn":"好久不见！梅丽莎，伽利！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x249FEC8DDE6E06B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321503002:1":{"text":"不过伽利你还好吗？满满隔着很远都听到你在打喷嚏。","source_cn":"不过伽利你还好吗？满满隔着很远都听到你在打喷嚏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1370264EC7C4AFD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321503003:2":{"text":"还……阿嚏……还吼，只是轻微的发粉——阿嚏！发粉过敏……","source_cn":"还……阿嚏……还吼，只是轻微的发粉——阿嚏！发粉过敏……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802A012C739442B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321503004:1":{"text":"这可不是轻微的花粉过敏！！你的脸都肿成嘴里塞满坚果的仓鼠了，说话也含糊不清的！要不是咱们搭档了这么多年，连我都听不清你在说什么！","source_cn":"这可不是轻微的花粉过敏！！你的脸都肿成嘴里塞满坚果的仓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57DC43384CFDC2A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321503005:1":{"text":"别再硬撑了，还是先回雪松镇休息吧！","source_cn":"别再硬撑了，还是先回雪松镇休息吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26953452D8AF2F11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docume