典，没想到却意外在雪松镇上买到了一件古董手环。","source_cn":"最近学会给我和伽利放了假，我们原本想趁这个机会好好体验...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01E2A4699F290393","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321503012:2":{"text":"虽然那件手环看上去锈迹斑斑的，一点也不起眼，但经过伽利的鉴定，它至少有上千年的历史！而且根据形制来看，它很可能属于某位贵族或者高阶骑士。","source_cn":"虽然那件手环看上去锈迹斑斑的，一点也不起眼，但经过伽利...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB247CFCA77DBC55A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321503013:1":{"text":"卖它的人说他就住在花海附近，时不时就会在地里翻出一些旧物件。包括这件手环，也是他家里人捡到的。所以伽利觉得，这片花海里一定有未被发现的古代墓穴。","source_cn":"卖它的人说他就住在花海附近，时不时就会在地里翻出一些旧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30154D5D1E3E9BEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321503014:2":{"text":"你们也知道他的性格，宁可不参加祭典也非要过来考察！只可惜我的大好假期……","source_cn":"你们也知道他的性格，宁可不参加祭典也非要过来考察！只可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6824BD54A1D71FA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321503015:2":{"text":"原来如此，难怪伽利这么坚持！","source_cn":"原来如此，难怪伽利这么坚持！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC050CBB63AB23BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321503016:2":{"text":"可就算